<%# locals: event — the one count the going/maybe/no line doesn't carry: how
    many of the society's members haven't answered. Members only, as before.
    Sits beside #header-rsvp-count in the RSVP card. turbo_stream replaces it
    on every RSVP, so it always renders (empty for non-members) to keep the
    target. The old card's status and created-date rows were dropped in the
    2026 redesign: the header already says whether the night is upcoming. %>
<span id="event-stats" class="tabular-nums">
  <% if user_signed_in? && event.society.has_member?(current_user) %>
    <span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
    <%= event.unanswered_count %> unanswered
  <% end %>
</span>
